function adminDashboard(b){let u=auth_(b.token),s=surveyCode_(b.code);if(!u)return unauth_();if(!s)return {ok:false};let em=employees_(),rs=responses_(s.SurveyId),latest={};rs.forEach(r=>{if(!latest[r.MaNV]||date_(r.UpdatedAt)>date_(latest[r.MaNV].UpdatedAt))latest[r.MaNV]=r});let sum={total:em.length,completed:0,inProgress:0,notStarted:0,refused:0},rows=em.map(e=>{let r=latest[e.MaNV],st=r?r.Status:'NOT_STARTED';if(st==='COMPLETED')sum.completed++;else if(st==='REFUSED')sum.refused++;else if(st==='IN_PROGRESS')sum.inProgress++;else sum.notStarted++;return {maNV:e.MaNV,hoTen:e.HoTen,cccd:mask_(e.CCCD),status:st,updatedAt:r?fmt_(r.UpdatedAt):''}});return {ok:true,summary:sum,rows,survey:pub_(s)}}
